475052", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771238_2267374423808385_8285232655195079020_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rnXM2bvKbNsQ7kNvwFa_CRT&_nc_oc=Adr4214xq3SORNaDgnsKp3s1tSbQBxG1UF3SwmH9-8_0wNJhfoiv9dzi0I0y6Bk94Lo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWBuwWGfKFJbk4_2IsMNWPILs_J4syX1Allsw8iWrqTcQ&oe=6B0F0CD9"}, {"file_name": "7-settings.png", "id": "2726878311100904", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771253_2726878317767570_2532212519509010382_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YqmXHplNLmcQ7kNvwES1F63&_nc_oc=AdrN7l5Q29PDkpbhTNpqOlE9vQnFBWiH5Gj-3ES_hRncDM-K0RdhGZgFOnrycy44cvE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQX4ZPYcRXcCvEkgIhJr-dwVuSm4I94ls0TTAynTl72EGQ&oe=6B0F21D4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "IMP: Immersive Media Player", "keywords": [], "long_description": "IMP is an immersive media player for the videos and pictures you already own. Watch them on a giant screen under a night sky, or in your own room with passthrough.\n\nPLAYS WHAT YOU HAVE \u2022 2D video and pictures on a screen you can resize, curve and move \u2022 3D side-by-side and top-bottom, 180\u00b0 and 360\u00b0 (fisheye too) \u2022 MP4, MKV, WebM, MOV, AVI; HEVC, H.264, VP9, AV1, MPEG-4 \u2022 Dolby Digital, DTS and TrueHD sound, audio tracks, subtitles\n\nFROM ANYWHERE AT HOME \u2022 Files on the headset \u2022 Shared folders on your PC or NAS (SMB), found by name \u2022 DLNA media servers, web links, HLS and DASH streams \u2022 Thumbnails, favourites, sorting, and resume where you stopped\n\nTURN 2D INTO 3D On-device AI depth models give flat videos and pictures real depth, on a screen and in 180\u00b0 and 360\u00b0. Nothing is uploaded. Videos on Quest 3, 3S and Pro; pictures on every headset.\n\nA SCREEN YOU CAN TAKE HOLD OF Move the screen with the trigger and resize it by its border. In passthrough, fix it to a wall or lay it over a real TV. In 180\u00b0 and 360\u00b0, drag the view and zoom with the thumbstick.\n\nFREE LIVE TV AND THE WEB Open any web address on the big screen, or browse public lists of free live channels by country, category or language. Add your own M3U playlist.\n\nControllers or hands, 14 languages, your display's full refresh rate.", "short_description": "Your own cinema in the headset. Play the videos and photos you have, from the headset, your PC or NAS (SMB), DLNA media servers and web links: flat 2D on a giant curved screen, 3D side-by-side and top-bottom, 180\u00b0 and 360\u00b0. On-device AI turns flat videos and pictures into 3D. Pin the screen to your wall or over a real TV in passthrough, or watch under a night sky, an aurora or by the sea."}]}, "developer_name": "TouchingCloud", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://apps.touching.cloud/imp-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TouchingCloud", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://apps.touching.cloud/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1171824665289638"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771282_1603222415206319_835966750881